<title>UK: No intervention grain sold at EU tender.</title>
<headline>No intervention grain sold at EU tender.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union sold no intervention grain at this week's export tender, member country officials said.</p>
<p>Bids for Swedish intervention barley were rejected, they said.</p>
</text>
